OL,3,CMichael Carrick to stay in charge of
OL,4,CManchester United for Chelsea game
OL,6,FMichael Carrick will remain as
OL,7,FManchester United head coach for
OL,8,FSaturday's Premier League match
OL,9,Fagainst Chelsea.
OL,11,FCarrick had arrived at Carrington
OL,12,Fearly on Tuesday October 27 with his
OL,13,Ffuture still up in the air after a 3-0
OL,14,Fdefeat by Bournemouth at Old Trafford
OL,15,Fon October 25 left his side 16th in
OL,16,Fthe table.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
