OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1793146712
OL,3,CMichael Carrick to stay in charge of
OL,4,CManchester United for Chelsea game
OL,6,FThe Old Trafford faithful's anger was
OL,7,Finstead aimed at the Glazers, co-owner
OL,8,FSir Jim Ratcliffe and the Ineos set-
OL,9,Fup, including United director of
OL,10,Ffootball Wilcox.
OL,12,FPlayers were booed at the final
OL,13,Fwhistle as they followed Carrick down
OL,14,Fthe tunnel on a day when the manager
OL,15,Fleft captain Bruno Fernandes on the
OL,16,Fbench.
OL,18,FThe 32-year-old Portuguese midfielder
OL,19,Fquestioned the manager's tactics after
OL,20,Ftheir 4-1 defeat to Como in the
OL,21,FChampions League.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
