OL,3,CMichael Carrick to stay in charge of
OL,4,CManchester United for Chelsea game
OL,6,FCarrick claimed the decision to name
OL,7,Fhim among the substitutes on Sunday
OL,8,Fwas a "pure football" decision rather
OL,9,Fthan punishment but the Portugal
OL,10,Finternational did not play a minute.
OL,12,FIt was the second public outburst from
OL,13,Fa Manchester United player this
OL,14,Fseason, after Lisandro Martinez was
OL,15,Ffined and brought in for talks after
OL,16,Fcriticising the club hierarchy after
OL,17,Fthe loss at Atletico Madrid.
