OL,3,CMichael Carrick to stay in charge of
OL,4,CManchester United for Chelsea game
OL,6,FThe Red Devils sit just a point above
OL,7,Fthe Premier League relegation zone in
OL,8,F16th place ahead of the trip to
OL,9,FChelsea, before heading into the
OL,10,Finternational break with home games
OL,11,Fagainst Roma and Aston Villa.
OL,13,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,14,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,15,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,16,Four region.
